(580,1251,'Inflammation of the mucous membrane of the nose similar to that found in hay fever except that symptoms persist throughout the year. The causes are usually air-borne allergens, particularly dusts, feathers, molds, animal fur, etc.','en',2,'2025-12-19 08:40:05',NULL,NULL,'18754FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
