(696,1443,'Rare, chronic, papulo-vesicular disease characterized by an intensely pruritic eruption consisting of various combinations of symmetrical, erythematous, papular, vesicular, or bullous lesions. The disease is strongly associated with the presence of HLA-B8 and HLA-DR3 antigens. A variety of different autoantibodies has been detected in small numbers in patients with dermatitis herpetiformis.','en',2,'2025-12-19 08:40:09',NULL,NULL,'5747FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
