(957,1952,'An affective disorder manifested by either a dysphoric mood or loss of interest or pleasure in usual activities. The mood disturbance is prominent and relatively persistent.','en',2,'2025-12-19 08:40:18',NULL,NULL,'13265FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
