(960,1965,'A chronic, relapsing, inflammatory, and often febrile multisystemic disorder of connective tissue, characterized principally by involvement of the skin, joints, kidneys, and serosal membranes. It is of unknown etiology, but is thought to represent a failure of the regulatory mechanisms of the autoimmune system. The disease is marked by a wide range of system dysfunctions, an elevated erythrocyte sedimentation rate, and the formation of LE cells in the blood or bone marrow.','en',2,'2025-12-19 08:40:19',NULL,NULL,'3347FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
