(1363,2810,'Acidosis caused by accumulation of lactic acid more rapidly than it can be metabolized. It may occur spontaneously or in association with diseases such as diabetes mellitus, leukemia, or liver failure.','en',2,'2025-12-19 08:40:34',NULL,NULL,'11078FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
