(1430,2924,'A major affective disorder marked by severe mood swings (manic or major depressive episodes) and a tendency to remission and recurrence.','en',2,'2025-12-19 08:40:35',NULL,NULL,'7949FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
(1431,2927,'Marked depression appearing in the involution period and characterized by hallucinations, delusions, paranoia, and agitation.','en',2,'2025-12-19 08:40:35',NULL,NULL,'7940FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
(1432,2928,'Skin diseases caused by bacteria, fungi, parasites, or viruses.','en',2,'2025-12-19 08:40:35',NULL,NULL,'11369FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
(1433,2932,'A syndrome characterized by abdominal wall musculature deficiency, cryptorchism, and urinary tract abnormalities. The syndrome derives its name from its characteristic distended abdomen with wrinkled skin.','en',2,'2025-12-19 08:40:36',NULL,NULL,'8582FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
(1434,2935,'A congenital fissure of the abdominal wall not involving the site of insertion of the umbilical cord, and usually accompanied by protrusion of the small and part of the large intestine. (Dorland, 28th ed)','en',2,'2025-12-19 08:40:36',NULL,NULL,'12341FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
(1435,2940,'Subnormal intellectual functioning which originates during the developmental period. This has multiple potential etiologies, including genetic defects and perinatal insults. Intelligence quotient (IQ) scores are commonly used to determine whether an individual is mentally retarded. IQ scores between 70 and 79 are in the borderline mentally retarded range. Scores below 67 are in the retarded range. (Joynt, Clinical Neurology, 1992, Ch55, p28)','en',2,'2025-12-19 08:40:36',NULL,NULL,'7936FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
(1436,2943,'The lack of sufficient energy or protein to meet the body&amp;amp;#39;s metabolic demands, as a result of either an inadequate dietary intake of protein, intake of poor quality dietary protein, increased demands due to disease, or increased nutrient losses.','en',2,'2025-12-19 08:40:36',NULL,NULL,'7930FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
